arent;"></div></figure>
<p>Once we reach node 6, the algorithm notices that its value violates its =
expected upper bound. As such, it returns false.</p>
<hr>
<p>In this DFS solution, the recursion starts at the root node, but values =
start being returned from the leaf nodes and bubble upwards to their parent=
 nodes. Below is a diagram showing how the boolean result at each node move=
s up from the leaf nodes to the root:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a binary decision tree illustrating a searc=
